  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I've verified your account, Helen. Thanks for your patience.\n\nI'm sorry the pad see ew wasn't in your Lotus Garden order. I can't issue a refund or credit for it myself. Your account has had several support refunds in the past 30 days, and when that happens, our policy is that a specialist has to review any new request.\n\nI've sent your case to a specialist (reference **ESC-700**) with the details: the pad see ew, $13.00, missing from order K-9601. They'll contact you within 24 hours. I can't promise what they'll decide, but they have everything they need, so you won't have to explain it again.\n\nCan I help with anything else?"
  },
