   "text": "Okay, so a specialist will look at it. My understanding is you can't see whether they'll approve anything, so I'll wait. One thing though: I'm a Forkful Plus member, so I'd expect that to count for something here, especially since I've been a member a long time.\n\nAlso, while you're at it, yesterday's Saffron Lane order never arrived at all. I'd like that looked at too. Order number is 9602."
