    "summary": "Verified account holder Helen Park reports Saffron Lane order K-9602 (placed 10/23, charged total $87.92) never arrived. Delivery events confirm order_lost at 19:30 on 10/23 (courier account suspended mid-delivery), with no handoff, so it would normally be owed in full (refund only; replacement not possible because it was placed yesterday). Account has 3 support refunds in the past 30 days (K-7301, K-7620, K-7790), so fraud review applies and nothing was issued. See also ESC-700 for K-9601."
