  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I looked into order K-9602, and I'm sorry about it. Our delivery records show the order was lost after pickup. The courier's account was suspended partway through the delivery, so your food never reached you. That wasn't your fault.\n\n**About your Plus membership:** I understand why you'd expect it to help, and I appreciate that you've been a member for a long time. Plus raises the dollar limits on what I can approve, but it doesn't change the review rule. Because of that review, I can't issue a refund or credit myself on either order.\n\n**What I've done for K-9602:** I've opened a second case for a specialist (reference **ESC-701**). It notes that our records confirm the order was lost and never delivered. A free replacement isn't possible because the order was placed yesterday, so a refund is what applies. The specialist will contact you within 24 hours. As with the other case, I can't promise what they'll decide.\n\n**Your two cases:**\n- **ESC-700:** pad see ew missing from order K-9601 (tonight, Lotus Garden)\n- **ESC-701:** order K-9602 never delivered (yesterday, Saffron Lane)\n\nCan I help with anything else?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, thanks. So both cases are with specialists now, ESC-700 for the pad see ew and ESC-701 for the Saffron Lane order that never came. I'd still rather have had some answer on the Plus point, but I understand you can't decide that yourself.\n\nI'll wait for their calls within 24 hours."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "That's right, Helen:\n\n- **ESC-700:** pad see ew missing from order K-9601 (Lotus Garden, tonight)\n- **ESC-701:** Saffron Lane order K-9602 never delivered (yesterday)\n\nSpecialists will follow up on both within 24 hours.\n\nTo answer your Plus question directly: your membership doesn't change this review. It works the same way for every member, however long they've been with us. You haven't done anything wrong. Any time an account gets several support refunds in a short period, a specialist reviews new requests. Your membership details are on your account, so the specialists will see them.\n\nI'm sorry about both orders, especially the one that never arrived. If anything else comes up, just message us."
  }
